    "summary": "Your army gets one use per phase. During the opposing side’s Movement phase, an enemy unit can trigger this by finishing a move 8\" or less from Nazdreg’s unit. If Nazdreg’s unit is unengaged, it may respond with a Normal Move capped at D6\". If already Riled Up, it can use a 5\" cap instead.",
